AB  - Abstract With the continuous development of 3D printing technology, 3D printing has been widely used in various industries. 3D printing has more and more consumables, more and more wastes are generated, and more and more pollution is generated to our environment. This system is based on the single-chip microcomputer, and uses the fuzzy PID algorithm to melt, shape and wire various types of 3D printing consumables at different temperatures. It can recycle 3D printing waste and directly use consumables for printing to reduce environmental pollution and printing cost.
