AB  - This work discusses the different types of materials with their significant properties utilized for 3D printing for various applications in the current scenario. As the application of 3D printing is enhancing day-by-day in every field because of its great benefits like light weight, any complex shape, porous structure, good strength and better mechanical and other properties, the researchers are making more and more materials which can be used as input material for 3D printer. The biodegradable and recyclable materials are getting more popular as compared to others because they will less harm our environment. Also, waste material recycling has become an important task these days.
