AB  - Turkey’s GDP has been growing at an average annual rate of 5% for nearly 30 years, which would put the country in the same league as India, Russia, and South Korea as a global economic power. Economically, the EU and Turkey have close ties, and Turkey has become one of the EU’s most important markets.\n\nThe electronics industry is also showing huge growth, several Turkish injection mold suppliers produce components for many well-known brands, about a third of the TVS of these components, are sold in Europe, and international well-known manufacturers such as Bosch and SONY have set up production plants in Turkey.\n\nTherefore, there are huge opportunities for plastic injection mold manufacturing and processing enterprises in Turkey. Its central location in Eurasia, between the Gulf states and Europe, makes Turkey an important partner. For several years, the Turkish injection mold industry has grown rapidly.\n\nIn the injection mold industry, Turkey now has a strong attraction for the European market, and injection mold supplier partnerships with Turkey are being established with increasing frequency.\n\nPlastic Injection molding manufacturers are thriving in Turkey, which has the advantage of being the gateway to Europe compared to manufacturers in Southeast Asia. Many Western European mold manufacturers, recognizing this, have set up branches in Turkey, hoping to get a piece of the action.\n\nAre you looking for injection molding suppliers in Turkey? We have compiled the top 5 injection molding suppliers list for you to pick as below:\n\n1. AdvanTech Plastics\n\nLocation: Turkey\nCompany type: Manufacturing\nYear founded: 1983\nThe number of employees: 500-599\nMain Services: Custom Molding, Engineering, Micro injection molding, Injection molding\n\nAdvanTech Plastics Company Profile\n\nAdvanTech Plastics is committed to providing the resources and expertise to meet customers’ injection molding services requirements with flawless execution, globally-competitive pricing, and true on-time, zero-defect performance.\n\nAdvanTech Plastics strives to ensure world-class results by providing design engineering, mold design and build, molding, and secondary operations. Their engineers and staff have the knowledge base, experience, and a zero-defect mentality to ensure efficient designs, rapid cycle times, obsessive attention to tolerances, and on-time delivery.\n\nFor more than 40 years they have been deeply committed to continuous innovation day after day all over the world. With WITTMANN 4.0, they provide the true Industry 4.0 solution by seamlessly integrating the complete work cell, including the injection molding machine, robot, and auxiliaries.\n\nRegarding efficiency and resource management, they put all their ambition into the constant innovation and progressive improvement of their products.\n\n2. GRAPHICS\n\nLocation: Izmir, Turkey\nCompany type: Manufacturing\nYear founded: 1987\nThe number of employees: 300-399\nMain products: Plastic injection molds, Progressive Patterns, Sheet Metal Forming Molds, Metal Injection Molds\n\nGRAPHICS Company Profile\n\nGrup HS Machinery Mold Industry and Trade Limited Company was established in Izmir in 1987 and became one of the companies that manufacture custom plastic injection mold and metal sheet forming molds in the sector. Thanks to its experienced staff, knowledge, and experience, our company works as a solution partner with many sectors.\n\nApart from plastic injection mold manufacturing and sheet metal forming mold manufacturing, its eccentric presses, CNC machining machines, electroerosion machines, grinders, hydraulic presses, plastic injection machines and laser marking machines, milling, lathe, welding machines, guillotine machines, and a wide range of contract manufacturing machines. addresses the scale.\n\nGrup HS Makina is located in a closed area of 1200 m 2 in Kısıkköy and the sectors it works in general; Defense Industry (ASELSAN), Petrochemical Industry (TÜPRAŞ), Ventilation Industry, Industrial Kitchen Industry, Body Industry, Paint Oven Manufacturing Industry, Medical Industry, and Lighting Products Industry are all sectors that require plastic injection mold manufacturing.\n\n3. NAMLI PLASTIC\n\nLocation: Tekirdağ, Turkey\nCompany type: Manufacturing\nYear founded: 2009\nThe number of employees: 300-399\nMain products: Injection Products, Thermoform Products, Molding Design\n\nNAMI PLASTIC Company Profile\n\nNAMI PLASTIC, which has been providing uninterrupted service to its customers in the Food Plastic Packaging Industry since 2009, aims to be the leader in its sector today.\n\nNotorious started its production in an area of 4,000 m2 and today continues its production at full speed in an area of 10,000 m2. Namlı, which can produce at an annual capacity of 7.000 tons with 32 injections and 2 thermoform production lines in the Çerkezköy Organized Industrial Zone, has distributors in many parts of Turkey and the world.\n\nNAMI PLASTIC BRC, which keeps its understanding of quality at the top of global standards without exception, has up-to-date quality certificates such as ISO. NAMI PLASTIC, which attaches great importance to customer satisfaction and experience, together with its experienced quality team, is constantly working to improve itself and make it higher quality in every aspect of plastic injection production.\n\n4. ATIL-SAN\n\nLocation: Istanbul, Turkey\nCompany type: Manufacturing\nYear founded: 2000\nThe number of employees: 200-299\nMain products: Plastic injection molding, plastic parts\n\nATIL-SAN Company Profile\n\nATIL-SAN car was set up in 2000, in Istanbul, Turkey, to fabricate auto-save parts. ATIL-SAN Automotive has a place with the ATILGAN gathering of organizations which is one of the biggest and most regarded gatherings in Turkey. The creation office of ATIL-SAN Automotive is set up on 7000 sq2 in Istanbul, Tuzla Organized Industrial Zone.\n\nThey produce as per ISO 9001-2000, ISO 14001-2004, and earth amicable conditions for FORD, VOLKSWAGEN, and MERCEDES gathering of vehicles. They offer plastic injection molding services and they have plans to have TS 16949 and Q1 accreditation.\n\nWith its wide scope of items and dissemination network which is made out of different recognized organizations situated all through Turkey(contracted OES ) and trading to organizations abroad.\n\n5. FORTIS Plastik\n\nLocation: Istanbul-Tuzla, Turkey\nCompany type: Manufacturing\nYear founded: 2002\nThe number of employees: 200-299\nMain products: Plastic injection mold, plastic parts\n\nFortis Plastik Company Profile\n\nFORTIS Plastik set up in 2002 and situated in Istanbul-Tuzla is creating the bundling business for over 10 years in its 4.000 m² cutting-edge processing plant. Sending out to more than 50 nations overall methods a unique test for the organization to serve more worldwide clients step by step.\n\nAmong its clients are wholesalers, dispersion organizations, plastic injection mold operators, market chains, bundling organizations, foodstuff makers, cooking firms, cafés, instructive foundations, lodgings, and so forth.\n\nThe assembling of plastic expendable cutlery, cups, stirrers, picks, and different items is completed under exacting quality standards. By utilizing just virgin, recyclable as well as biodegradable material from plastic injection molding manufacturers and worldwide crude material makers they don’t leave anything to possibilities.\n\nIf you’re looking for more plastic injection molding manufacturers, Also you can choose a China plastic injection molding supplier: Zetar Mold\n\nZetar Mold\n\nLocation: Shanghai, China\nCompany type: Manufacturing\nYear founded: 2005\nThe number of employees: 201-300\nMain product: Plastic Injection Mold, Plastic Injection Molding Manufacturing\nOther products: Injection molding manufacturing, Insert Molding Products, 3D printing, and CNC Prototyping\n\nZetar Company Profile\n\nZetar is a top-end turnkey China injection molding manufacturing company that helps wholesalers and brand owners fulfill their products.\n\nZetar has more than 20 English speakers and 7 experienced mold design engineers (some of them can also speak English) with technique and English communication, which could make sure fluent communication and offer feasible design solutions.\n\nNow total Zetar has mold making shop in-house, with 31 sets of injection molding machines ranging from 60T-1100T. which 6 sets are in the dust-free room(M7 Class), assembly room, and logo printing room. The largest 1100T injection molding machines could produce product weight up to 5100g.\n\nStar also has many certificates: TUV, ISO9001 (quality system certification), TS16949 (certification for auto parts making), and ISO14001 (certification for showing not harming the environment during the whole manufacturing process).\n\nConclusion\n\nFinding a trustworthy manufacturer nowadays is not that easy, especially since there are a lot of new manufacturers that have emerged just to keep up with the trend. But hopefully, our list was able to help you find the injection mold supplier that best suits your requirements. It is recommended to do a background check before creating partnerships with manufacturers because they will play a huge part in the success of your business.
